WEBVTT

00:16:58.401 --> 00:17:01.483
koja pokazuje kolegama svoje dokaze.

00:17:01.483 --> 00:17:03.340
Ovi ljudi, naravno,
ne izgledaju kao znanstvenici


00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:05.326
Jer izgledaju previše sretno.

00:17:05.326 --> 00:17:09.338
(Smijeh)

00:17:09.338 --> 00:17:13.660
Ovo me vodi do konačnog zaključka.

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:16.308
Mnogi od nas ustaju ujutro.

00:17:16.308 --> 00:17:17.718
Vjeruju svojim autima.

00:17:17.718 --> 00:17:19.260
Kad razmislimo o tome, ja sam s Manhattana,

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:20.558
ovo je loša analogija,

00:17:20.558 --> 00:17:23.382
ali mnogi Amerikanci koji nisu s Manhattana

00:17:23.382 --> 00:17:25.120
ustaju ujutro i ulaze u auto

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:27.649
upale auto i on radi

00:17:27.649 --> 00:17:29.650
Nevjerojatno dobro.

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:32.365
Moderni se automobili rijetko kada pokvare